{"name":"Immortal","hex":"#c0a9cc","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"immortal","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Not susceptible to death; living forever; never dying.","Never to be forgotten; that merits being always remembered."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["One who is not susceptible to death.","A preeminent or exemplary person or thing; a paragon."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/immortal"}],"entries":[{"title":"The Immortals (1995 film)","blocks":[{"text":"The Immortals is a 1995 action thriller film produced by Elie Samaha and directed by Brian Grant. Eric Roberts, Tia Carrere, Joe Pantoliano, Chris Rock, William Forsythe, Clarence Williams III and Tony Curtis feature in this film."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/12/The_immortals_movie_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Immortals_(1995_film)","wikidata":"Q2253595"},{"title":"Immortal (2026 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Immortal is a 2026 Indian Tamil-language romantic horror film written and directed by newcomer Mariyappan Chinna. The film stars G. V. Prakash Kumar and Kayadu Lohar. The cast also includes T. M. Karthik, Kumar Natarajan, Lollu Sabha Maaran, Aaditya Kathir, Arshu Maharjan, Pema Tsamchoe, and Sunita Shrestha. Shot between May 2025 and May 2026, the film was released on 4 September 2026."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/34/Immortal_2026_poster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Immortal_(2026_film)","wikidata":"Q141174653"},{"title":"Immortal (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Immortal is a Norwegian black metal band from Bergen. The group was founded in 1991 by frontman and guitarist Abbath Doom Occulta and guitarist Demonaz Doom Occulta. The pair worked with various drummers, and were joined by former drummer Horgh in 1996."}]